# Heretek-Crew ignores — fail-closed hygiene for secrets, dumps, workspace outputs.
# - .env / .env.local hold real secrets (see .env.example template). NEVER commit them.
# - backups/ holds pg_dump outputs (database bytes). NEVER commit them.
# - workspaces/ holds agent checkouts / runtime outputs; keep the dir, ignore contents.
# - Standard hygiene: logs, OS metadata, node_modules.

.env
.env.local
backups/
workspaces/*
!workspaces/.gitkeep
*.log
.DS_Store
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
